{"metadata": {"timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "total_runs": 75, "errors": 7, "judge": {"judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_is_local": false, "evaluations": 14, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.0171}, "partial": true, "archivado": "2026-08-18", "motivo": "finish_reason=length · techo de tokens"}, "results": [{"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 6.79, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.54, "test_name": "atribucion_correlacion_temporal", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 36.033, "latency_first_token": 57.243, "latency_total": 57.243, "input_tokens": 259, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "**Conclusión: No se puede saber.**\n\nAtribuir el crecimiento del MRR y el aumento de las altas a la secuencia de emails es una trampa estadística clásica de \"correlación no implica causalidad\". Con los datos que tienes, cualquier conclusión sería una respuesta cómoda pero falsa.\n\nAquí te explico por ", "auto_quality": 8.4, "content_score": 6.0, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1181, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "f29d84cb5b36", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/atribucion_correlacion_temporal__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 5.333, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.49, "test_name": "churn_mezcla_free_y_pago", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 34.733, "latency_first_token": 59.997, "latency_total": 59.997, "input_tokens": 189, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "Respira. Como analista de retención, mi primer paso siempre es verificar qué población estamos midiendo antes de interpretar cualquier métrica, y **aquí está el problema: tu panel está midiendo la población equivocada.**\n\nNo tienes un churn del 31%. Tienes un problema de definición en tu dashboard. ", "auto_quality": 8.14, "content_score": 5.34, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1383, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "7a1379bbfcf0", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/churn_mezcla_free_y_pago__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 9.333, "cost_score": 6.78, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 5.333, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.023, "test_name": "roadmap_restriccion_capacidad", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 31.8, "latency_first_token": 65.748, "latency_total": 65.748, "input_tokens": 279, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "Como jefe de producto en una empresa de una persona, mi trabajo no es soñar con el producto perfecto, sino **maximizar el retorno de cada hora** que tú, como fundador, puedes meter en el teclado. \n\nAquí tienes la realidad de tu trimestre desglosada en números duros:\n\n### La capacidad real\n*   Tienes", "auto_quality": 8.4, "content_score": 6.0, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1204, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "3ae7a97b94b5", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/roadmap_restriccion_capacidad__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 3.333, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 3.873, "test_name": "teardown_competidor_sin_inventar", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 36.533, "latency_first_token": 56.086, "latency_total": 56.086, "input_tokens": 201, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "Como analista competitivo, mi trabajo es separar rigurosamente los datos objetivos de las suposiciones. En un \"teardown\" (análisis de teardown) basado únicamente en información pública, el riesgo de error es alto, por lo que cada afirmación irá acompañada de su nivel de certeza.\n\nAquí tienes el desg", "auto_quality": 3.34, "content_score": 5.34, "answer_score": 2.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1485, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "1359665087e4", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/teardown_competidor_sin_inventar__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 8.0, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.14, "test_name": "roast_oferta_sin_cliches", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 37.9, "latency_first_token": 54.037, "latency_total": 54.037, "input_tokens": 190, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "Escúchame bien: tu oferta es ruido. Es el equivalente a poner un cartel que dice \"Comida\" en la puerta de un restaurante. Es tan genérica que el cerebro del visitante la borra en 0.3 segundos. Estás vendiendo una commodity disfrazada de solución.\n\nAquí tienes la autopsia, sin anestesia, y cómo resuc", "auto_quality": 6.94, "content_score": 5.34, "answer_score": 8.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1335, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "b9443fdcd3c0", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/roast_oferta_sin_cliches__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 9.443, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 5.333, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.103, "test_name": "validacion_idea_intencion_vs_compra", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 32.467, "latency_first_token": 64.15, "latency_total": 64.15, "input_tokens": 190, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "No renuncias. Ni se te ocurra. \n\nHe visto morir a cientos de founders con métricas exactamente como las tuyas. Tienes un montón de validación de *intención* y cero validación de *acción*. En el mundo de las inversiones, la diferencia entre lo que la gente dice y lo que la gente paga es la diferencia", "auto_quality": 8.4, "content_score": 6.0, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1055, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "e2cc5b652a8c", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/validacion_idea_intencion_vs_compra__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 6.79, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.54, "test_name": "escalar_con_ltv_mal_calculado", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 43.433, "latency_first_token": 47.338, "latency_total": 47.338, "input_tokens": 221, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "**No le doy. Le pongo un semáforo rojo.**\n\nComo analista de unit economics, mi trabajo es matar los planes bonitos antes de que maten la empresa. Tu plan muere en la aritmética, y te voy a explicar por qué.\n\nTu error está en dos suposiciones clásicas de fundadores optimistas: **calculaste el LTV con", "auto_quality": 8.14, "content_score": 5.34, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1456, "suite": "business_audit", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "e991ab57a635", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_audit/escalar_con_ltv_mal_calculado__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 8.0, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.14, "test_name": "disenar_experimento_para_matar_la_idea", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 36.333, "latency_first_token": 56.355, "latency_total": 56.355, "input_tokens": 204, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "Como fundador, sabes que el mayor riesgo no es que la tecnología no funcione, sino que construyas un producto magnífico que nadie quiere pagar. Si te metes a construir durante 2 meses, caerás en el sesgo de confirmación: te enamorarás de tu solución y buscarás excusas para no escuchar al mercado.\n\nP", "auto_quality": 7.2, "content_score": 6.0, "answer_score": 8.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1411, "suite": "business_strategy", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "45e63a1c3f92", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_strategy/disenar_experimento_para_matar_la_idea__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.55, "test_name": "monetizar_sin_matar_el_activo", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 35.367, "latency_first_token": 57.953, "latency_total": 57.953, "input_tokens": 163, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "**NO LO HAGAS.** \n\nSi lo haces, estarás matando a la gallina de los huevos de oro. Como estratega, mi trabajo es proteger el activo, y tu activo no son tus artículos; **tu activo es el tráfico orgánico de Google.** \n\nPoner un muro de pago duro (hard paywall) al 100% de tu contenido es un suicidio SE", "auto_quality": 8.4, "content_score": 6.0, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1344, "suite": "business_strategy", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "004edade481d", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/business_strategy/monetizar_sin_matar_el_activo__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 6.8, "cost_usd": 0.003, "speed": 6.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 8.55, "test_name": "restriccion_que_pelea_con_el_pedido", "model": "LongCat 2.0", "model_id": "meituan/longcat-2.0", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 42.033, "latency_first_token": 48.716, "latency_total": 48.716, "input_tokens": 169, "output_tokens": 2048, "response_preview": "\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   **Role:** Copywriter.\n    *   **Platform:** LinkedIn.\n    *   **Topic:** Entrepreneur community growth.\n    *   **Core Message:** How much it grew (WhatsApp group with acquaintances -> courses, live sessions, organic reach) in 18 months.\n    *   **Constraint 1:*", "auto_quality": 8.14, "content_score": 5.34, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "AtlasCloud", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "length", "reasoning_tokens": 1423, "suite": "content_verificable", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_longcat-2.0", "prompt_sha": "11a6b052934c", "response_file": "results/responses/longcat-2.0/content_verificable/restriccion_que_pelea_con_el_pedido__20260818_longcat-2.0.md", "runs_averaged": 3}]}